Byte-by-byte Description of file: table_A2.mrt
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Bytes Format Units  Label     Explanations
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 1- 6   A6     ---    star name      Star name
 8-16   A9     ---    TIC            TESS Input Catalog ID
