30-33   F4.2   K      log_Teff      [4.45/4.57] log10 effective temperature
35-38   F4.2   K      e_log_Teff    [0.01/0.02] Uncertainty on log10 effective
                                  temperature
40-43   F4.2   solLum log_L         [5.13/5.89] log10 luminosity
45-48   F4.2   solLum e_log_L       [0.01/0.01] Uncertainty on log10 luminosity
50-53   F4.1   solMass M             [22.1/35.3] Mass
55-58   F4.1   solMass e_M           [5.8/13.2] Uncertainty on mass
60-72   A13    ---    FFI sectors    TESS sectors with FFI data
74-78   A5     ---    2-min sectors  TESS sectors with 2-min cadence data
80-92   A13    ---    Variability    Type of variability observed in TESS light
                                  curve

